     SUBORDINATE WRITER on PRE_EXISTING_DISEASE_DESCRIPTION: run opus_health_legacy_v4, 1 writer(s), registry/ies HUB_PARTY_BK__MEMBER_NO, HUB_PARTY_BK__PD_PREMIUM_PAYER_ID -- its value is DISCARDED wherever opus_health_v2 also writes the same key
   DECLARED SOURCE PRECEDENCE -- 1 attribute(s) are written by BOTH runs.
